# Intermediates of the office art pipeline (art/build/). The scripts and their two inputs are
# tracked; everything they produce is either regenerated in seconds or already in the app.
#   PLATE.png            1.5 MB lossless working copy, and the input to grid6.py
#   office-layout*.json  lives in index.html as `const L=`; a second copy only drifts
art/build/PLATE.png
art/build/office-layout.json
art/build/office-layout.min.json
